      "final_text": "美国市场：美国股票连续第二周上涨（标普500指数 +1.1%，纳斯达克指数 +1.6%），尽管半导体板块表现疲软（DRAM -5.3%，SOX -4.3%）。大型科技股表现分化，但软件股跑赢大盘（MSFT +21.8%，AMZN +17%，AAPL -7.2%，META -6.5%）。美国国债收益率走势分化，收益率曲线趋于陡峭（2年期 -4个基点至4.29%，10年期 +6个基点至4.73%，30年期 +12个基点至5.27%）。30年期国债收益率触及2007年以来的高位。7月联邦公开市场委员会会议维持利率于3.50%-3.75%不变，3位委员持异议，支持加息25个基点。美元指数下跌 -1.5%，黄金上涨 +0.9%，布伦特原油下跌 -8.9%至约$90，尽管中东局势再度紧张。美国Q2 GDP年化增速为 +1.5%，低于市场预期的 +2.1%及Q1的 +2.1%。核心PCE弱于预期，年化增速为 +1.6%。",
      "iterations": 2,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. equities gained for the second straight week (S&P 500 +1.1%, Nasdaq +1.6%) despite weakness in semiconductors (DRAM -5.3%, SOX -4.3%). Big tech was mixed though software outperformed (MSFT +21.8%, AMZN +17%, AAPL -7.2%, META -6.5%). Treasury yields were mixed with curve steepening (2Y -4bps to 4.29%, 10Y +6bps to 4.73%, 30Y +12bps to 5.27%). The 30Y reached some of its highest levels since 2007. Rates were held at 3.50-3.75% with 3 dissenters in favor of a 25bps hike at the July FOMC meeting. The dollar index fell -1.5%, gold gained +0.9%, Brent crude fell -8.9% to ~$90 even as hostilities resumed in the Middle East. U.S. Q2 GDP growth printed +1.5% annualized, below expectations for +2.1% and Q1’s +2.1%. Core PCE was weaker than expected at +1.6% annualized.",
